body='<h1>Sources, rights and privacy</h1><section class="panel"><h2>Technical scope</h2><p>EU GMP principles for an introductory human-medicinal-product IQ module. Official source index checked on 6 November 2026. Annex 15 remains listed as operational from 1 October 2015; a revision concept paper is not adopted guidance. This is not complete Indian/US/sterile/CSV compliance training.</p>'+links()+'<p><a href="https://health.ec.europa.eu/medicinal-products/eudralex/eudralex-volume-4_en">Official EudraLex index</a>. Each worked acceptance value is a fictional teaching assumption, not a universal GMP limit.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Media provenance</h2><p>Original scripted illustrations and narration; no stock photographs, music, patient data or client records. Speech uses Kokoro v1.0 stock af_heart voice; no personal voice cloning or paid voice API. Model publisher declares Apache-2.0; ONNX runtime wrapper is MIT. These notices do not independently establish upstream training-data rights or exclusive output ownership.</p><p><a href="https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M">Model publisher</a> · <a href="/assets/academy/module-4/review/Apache-2.0.txt">Apache notice</a> · <a href="/assets/academy/module-4/review/kokoro-onnx-MIT.txt">Runtime notice</a> · <a href="/assets/academy/dejavu-font-notice.txt">DejaVu font notice</a></p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Privacy and storage</h2><p>Same-origin videos load after Play; page/image/caption requests may occur earlier. The site host receives ordinary IP and request metadata. Hosting retention, logging and account-level controls require operator confirmation. Module 4 adds no third-party analytics, embeds or learner uploads.</p><p>Optional localStorage key valistera_module4_v1 stores preference, studied lesson IDs, passed checks and latest score. Saving defaults off. Opt-out and Clear remove this module key. Workbook answers are not saved. Storage failures leave learning available. This is not an LMS or auditable GMP training record.</p><a href="/privacy.html">Website privacy policy</a></section><p><a href="/academy-module-4-review.html">Review status and evidence</a>. Human audiovisual, accessibility and independent GMP acceptance remain separate from automated QA. Module 3 approval does not approve Module 4.</p>'
page('Sources, rights and privacy',body,'academy-module-4-sources.html')
